# Where the fields of a record lie does not hang on how many calls of its maker the program holds: every reader and writer of the layout would be other code by one call more.
# Only what the body of a module makes is taken to be made once. The twin, ..-is-called-twice.ir, is this program and its last block once more: the check lines are the same.
# RUN: plan layouts mechanisms=all
# CHECK: layout L0 CompiledObject
# CHECK: "isMarked" JSValue OutOfLine
# CHECK: "never" JSValue OutOfLine
# CHECK: "note" JSValue OutOfLine
